# Pin working-tree and committed text to LF; a committed eol outranks core.autocrlf.
# Keep this line first.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep-list for the GitHub download (the keep-the-download-to-what-runs rule): every
# top-level entry is left out of `git archive`, then each path the plugin runs is put
# back. A new runtime folder needs its `-export-ignore` line in the same change;
# scripts/check-download-archive.mjs (the download-archive CI job) fails otherwise.
/* export-ignore
/.* export-ignore
/includes -export-ignore
/uamswp-bis-regenerate.php -export-ignore
